{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And according to all its laws.</b> Rashi explained: such as seven days for matzah and for removal of leaven — for the seven days, as it is written ״שבעת ימים תאכל מצות״; for matzah, as it is written ״על מצות ומרורים יאכלהו״; for removal of leaven, as it is written ״לא תזבח על חמץ דם זבחי״."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:17:05.035042363Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}